      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="detail__body" data-reveal-children>
      <p>
        I’m a senior design leader who stays close to the craft while building up the
        people around me. I’ve spent more than ten years in financial services, mostly
        in digital products and brand-led design. I lead UX for the app team at RACV.
        Before that I briefly directed a small design team at Western Union. At ANZ Plus
        I was a founding designer, leading product, web and brand design.
      </p>

      <p>
        I care about clear systems and fast feedback. My work usually moves from
        concepts to prototypes, then into a story that gets people aligned on strategy.
        I enjoy every part of product design, from leading a workshop to finessing the
        detail of a micro-interaction. I lead hands-on and by example, aiming to bring
        clarity, care and momentum to every project.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
